    "caption": "Great ingredients can make even the simplest recipes absolutely stunning. This quick Caprese Salad is proof of this, as the sum of its flavors is bigger than its parts. It’s fresh, creamy, cheesy, tart, and herby, all at once. Give it a try, and it just might be your new brunch time go-to. \n\nTo appreciate this harmonious appetizer even more, pair it with a light white wine like Villa Maria Blush Sauvignon. Its delicate floral profile gives freshness and slight berry notes, which complement the cheese and herb flavors of this salad nicely.\n\nServing time: 10 minutes\nYield: 1-2 servings\nIngredients\n¼ cup balsamic vinegar \n½ cup olive oil \n1 tsp. Italian seasoning \nSalt and pepper to taste\n1 (100g) ball fresh mozzarella, torn into pieces \n4 pcs. plum tomatoes \n½ cup cherry tomatoes, sliced\n¼ cup basil sprigs\nVilla Maria Blush Sauvignon\n\nProcedure\nWhisk together balsamic vinegar, olive oil and Italian seasoning. Season with salt and pepper. \nIn your serving plate, assemble together mozzarella, tomatoes and basil. \nDrizzle with balsamic dressing.\nEnjoy with Villa Maria Blush Sauvignon.\n\nYou can now order your groceries online at https://bit.ly/TheMarketplaceGoCart. Come and join our Viber community as well at https://bit.ly/TheMarketplaceViber",
