    "categoryConfidence": "medium",
    "campaign": "WORLD OF WINE",
    "caption": "Make a restaurant caliber meal at home with this surprisingly easy Beef Tenderloin with Seared Mushrooms and Beef Jus recipe. This delicious date night meal comes together in just 45 minutes, leaving plenty of time for good conversations over wine.\n\nWe recommend the Château Argadens Bordeaux Supérieur for this, both as a sauce ingredient and meal accompaniment. Its classic red Bordeaux profile that works so well for both cooking and sipping. In the mouth, it's spicy and earthy, with dark fruit flavors and the distinct dry feel of tannins–the sign of a well aged grapes from that region.\n\nServing time: 45 minutes\nYield: 2 servings\n\nIngredients\n2 pcs. fillet mignon \nSalt and pepper to taste\n2 tbsps. olive oil \n2 tbsps. butter \n3 cloves garlic\n2 sprigs fresh thyme \n1 white onion, diced\n1 tbsp. flour\n½ cup Château Argadens Bordeaux Supérieur\n1 cup beef stock\n1 tbsp. worcestershire sauce\n3 tbsps. butter\n3 pcs. trumpet mushrooms, sliced vertically and scored\n\nProcedure\nPat-dry fillet mignon steaks, then season with salt and pepper on all sides. \nHeat up a cast iron pan over high heat, then add in olive oil. Once smoking, sear fillet mignon until you achieve a nicely browned crust on all sides. Reduce heat to medium, then add in butter, garlic and thyme. Baste steak for 2-3 minutes, or until your desired doneness. For medium doneness, remove steak when the internal temperature reaches 130C. Let rest covered with foil for 5-8 minutes. \nIn the same pan with beef drippings, sauté onion until soft. Mix in flour, and cook until lightly darkened. Pour in Château Argadens Bordeaux Supérieur, and let reduce to half. Mix in beef stock and worcestershire sauce. Simmer for 3-5 minutes, then season with salt and pepper to taste.\nSear trumpet mushrooms in butter, then season with salt and pepper. \nPlate fillet mignon with trumpet mushrooms, beef jus and other preferred side dishes. Enjoy with Château Argadens Bordeaux Supérieur. \n\nYou can now order your groceries online at https://bit.ly/TheMarketplaceGoCart. Come and join our Viber community as well at https://bit.ly/TheMarketplaceViber",
